    "root_cause": "config_error",
    "summary": "A platform config cleanup (env revision r118) renamed DATABASE_URL to DB_URL in checkout-service's environment, but the service still reads DATABASE_URL. Running pods were unaffected until the routine v3.4.1 rollout restarted them; every new replica then failed at startup. The release itself changed no config handling, so rolling it back would not help.",
